const dashboardHTML=`<!doctype html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Monitor</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/style.css"></head><body><header><h2>◉ Monitor</h2><a href="/password" style="color:#d5e6ff">修改密码</a><form method="post" action="/logout"><button>退出</button></form></header><main><div class="stats"><div><small>节点数量</small><strong id="total">—</strong></div><div><small>在线节点</small><strong id="online">—</strong></div><div><small>离线节点</small><strong id="offline">—</strong></div></div><div class="toolbar"><h3>服务器</h3><button type="button" id="add-node">＋ 添加服务器</button><span id="updated">加载中</span></div><section id="nodes"></section><section class="history-panel"><h3>节点管理</h3><form id="metadata-form"><select id="metadata-name"></select><input id="metadata-display" maxlength="60" placeholder="中文显示名称"><input id="metadata-group" maxlength="40" placeholder="分组"><textarea id="metadata-notes" maxlength="500" placeholder="备注"></textarea><button type="submit">保存显示信息</button><span id="metadata-status"></span></form><p class="muted">删除会删除历史采样并拒绝旧令牌；撤销仅停用旧令牌；改名后必须为新节点重新生成令牌并更改 Agent 配置。</p><select id="manage-name" aria-label="管理节点"></select> <input id="rename-target" placeholder="新节点名称"> <button id="rename-node">重命名</button> <button id="revoke-node">撤销令牌</button> <button id="delete-node">删除节点</button><p id="manage-status" class="muted"></p></section><section class="history-panel" id="add-panel" hidden><h3>添加服务器 / 更新令牌</h3><p class="muted">输入唯一节点标识，仅限英文、数字、横线和下划线。重用名称将立即使旧令牌失效。</p><form id="create-node"><input id="node-name" placeholder="例如 hk-01" required maxlength="64" pattern="[A-Za-z0-9_-]+"><input id="server-url" placeholder="https://monitor.example.com" type="url" required><button type="submit">生成专属安装命令</button></form><p id="create-status" class="muted"></p><textarea id="install-command" rows="4" readonly spellcheck="false" aria-label="安装命令"></textarea><button id="copy-command" type="button">复制命令</button><p class="muted">安装命令含专属密钥，只可在可信任的服务器执行，执行后建议清理命令历史。若节点已存在，生成新令牌会让旧 Agent 掉线。</p></section><section class="history-panel"><h3>历史趋势</h3><div class="history-controls"><select id="history-name" aria-label="服务器"></select><select id="history-hours" aria-label="范围"><option value="24">24 小时</option><option value="168">7 天</option><option value="720">30 天</option></select><select id="history-metric" aria-label="指标"><option value="cpu">CPU</option><option value="memory">内存</option><option value="disk">磁盘</option></select></div><canvas id="history-chart" width="900" height="260" aria-label="历史趋势图"></canvas><p id="history-status" class="muted"></p></section><section class="history-panel"><h3>历史网络流量</h3><p id="traffic-summary" class="muted">选择节点和时间范围查看接收、发送量。</p><div id="traffic-bars"></div></section><p class="muted">每 5 秒更新 · 离线判定 30 秒 · V0.6</p></main><script src="/static/app.js" defer></script></body></html>`
